      "writtenOn": "2022-11-08T10:19:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Shouldn\u0027t this be `\u0026\u0026`? What if device first becomes an Out device and then becomes also an In device. Would we register the same callback twice?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 968,
        "startChar": 46,
        "endLine": 968,
        "endChar": 48
